note hub/src/45-pages.om: the stack page, the evidence page, the protocol overview and the six
note protocol pages whose bodies come from 60-protocol.om.

text s01 "<section class='sec' id='planes'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>By plane</p><h2>Four planes and the line through them</h2><p class='sub'>Each project belongs to one subsystem, and each subsystem to a plane. The bar is the share of that subsystem&#39;s code lines already written in Omega.</p>\n"
text s02 "</div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='ledger'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>The measured stack</p><h2>What each project is made of</h2><p class='sub'>"
text s03 " projects, "
text s04 " files, counted line by line by an Omega program, <code>tools/ledger.om</code>: "
text s05 " lines of Omega and "
text s06 " lines of other languages. The other lines are migration still to do, not a different destination.</p><div class='scroll'><table class='tbl'><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>Subsystem</th><th class='r'>Omega lines</th><th class='r'>Other lines</th><th class='r'>Omega share</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n"
text s07 "</tbody></table></div></div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='projects'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>On Radicle</p><h2>Every public project, and the commit to fetch</h2><p class='sub'>"
text s08 " public projects, each in its own Radicle repository. Clone one peer to peer with <code>rad clone</code>, or read-only with <code>git clone</code> from the mirror on my own seed. The head is the commit the front door lists.</p><div class='scroll'><table class='tbl'><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>About</th><th>Get it</th><th class='r'>Head</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n"
text s09 "</tbody></table></div></div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='get'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>One command</p><h2>Get everything</h2><div class='prose'>"
text s10 "</div></div></section>\n"
text sr1 "<tr id='p-"
text sr2 "'><td class='n'>"
text sr3 "<span class='rid'>"
text sr4 "</span></td><td>"
text sr5 "</td><td class='r'>"
text sr6 "%</td></tr>\n"
text sr7 "</td></tr>\n"
text snl "not measured"
text sp1 "<tr id='r-"
text sp2 "'><td class='n'><a href='https://radicle.network/nodes/rosa.radicle.network/"
text sp3 "'>"
text sp4 "</a>"
text sp5 "<span class='core'>CORE</span>"
text sp6 "</span></td><td>"
text sp7 "</td><td><code>rad clone "
text sp8 "</code><br><a href='https://www.aienos.com/rad/"
text sp9 ".git'>git mirror</a></td><td class='r'><code>"
text spa "</code></td></tr>\n"
text score "core"
text sq1 "Get everything"
text e01 "<section class='sec' id='proved'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>On the chip, on the host, in service</p><h2>What I proved, and at which level</h2><div class='prose'>"
text e02 "</div></div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='seed'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>Verified to the seed</p><h2>Built from the seed</h2><div class='prose'>"
text e03 "</div></div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='limits'><div class='wrap'><div class='two'><div><p class='eyebrow'>Still outside</p><h2>What is still NVIDIA&#39;s</h2><div class='prose'>"
text e04 "</div></div><div><p class='eyebrow'>Open work</p><h2>What I have not done yet</h2><div class='prose'>"
text e05 "</div></div></div></div></section>\n<section class='sec' id='papers'><div class='wrap'><p class='eyebrow'>Written down</p><h2>All my papers</h2><div class='prose'>"
text e06 "</div></div></section>\n"
